/svg> <span class=\"full_label\">Related games</span><span class=\"mobile_label\">Related</span></a></li></ul><script type=\"text/javascript\">new I.GameUserTools('#user_tools')</script><div id=\"wrapper\" class=\"main wrapper game_page_wrapper\"><div id=\"inner_column\" class=\"inner_column size_large family_anonymous-pro\"><div class=\"header\" id=\"header\"><h1 itemprop=\"name\" class=\"game_title\">EYEBLIND</h1></div><div class=\"view_game_page page_widget base_widget direct_download\" id=\"view_game_6690994\"><div class=\"header_buy_row\"><p>A downloadable game for Windows</p><div class=\"direct_download_row\"><button class=\"button direct_download_btn\" type=\"button\"><svg height=\"22\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" version=\"1.1\" class=\"svgicon icon_download\" stroke-width=\"2\" fill=\"none\" role=\"img\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" stroke=\"currentColor\" aria-hidden width=\"22\"><path d=\"M21 15v4a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2v-4\"></path><polyline points=\"7 10 12 15 17 10\"></polyline><line x1=\"12\" y1=\"15\" x2=\"12\" y2=\"3\"></line></svg> Download</button></div></div><div class=\"columns\"><div class=\"left_col column\"><div class=\"formatted_description user_formatted\"><p>Rumor says; One of the most succesful hospitals became abandoned due to &quot;fatal mistake&quot;, mistake for which a young hospitalized girl had to die for.&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>The daughter has been loved by her father more than he loved himself.&nbsp;He knew that one of the most succesful hospitals couldn&#x27;t just mess things up this easily, he knew there is something more to this. For 3 years he had been been seeing her whenever he blinks on the hour she had died - 10:43 PM that is.&nbsp;Since her death he was completely alone.&nbsp;He had decided to visit the hospital once again, he wanted to spend a night here and end his life. When he entered the hospital he was obviously terrified, seeing those walls... Remembering every smile she gave... As he wandered alone, he opened the door to the operation room where she had died.&nbsp;&nbsp;He lied down near the rusty bed and started to reflect on his life once again. He stared at the empty space, minutes have passed... He heard someone walk in corridor, he saw walls beggining to get &quot;veins&quot;...Then he was getting choked by something, but he couldn&#x27;t see it!&nbsp;Just before the clock struck&nbsp;10:43PM he quickly grasped for air.&nbsp;Rumor says he saw the death trying to strangle him, he saw the eyes of death staring at him... For whatever reason the strangling stopped, but he never left the hospital...</p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p><br></p>\r\n<p>// game made for Spooktober 8th Annual Visual Novel Game Jam</p>\r\n<p>//&nbsp;-=-= =&nbsp; =&nbsp; &nbsp;=&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; INFO FOR NERDS!&nbsp;</p>\r\n<p>&nbsp;this game originally should be done in 5 days lol.</p>\r\n<p>I&#x27;ve started this project 10 days before september, so I had little to no time to do music, writing, and art... (its visible lol). Thus I&nbsp;have no intentions to win, but it was a really fun thing to do, it&#x27;s my first time participating in any game jam.</p>\r\n<p>What I honestly think about this game is that if I were to polish it, it would turn out pretty good, a lot of things there are poorly written, poorly drawn, and poorly composed...</p>\r\n<p>I wanted to focus the most on music but well... I started recording sountrack 5 days before release so yeah...&nbsp;They just... are...</p>\r\n<p>I think this is my least serious game :sob:</p></div><div class=\"more_information_toggle\"><div class=\"toggle_row\"><a href=\"javascript:void(0)\" class=\"toggle_info_btn\">More information<svg height=\"6\" role=\"img\" class=\"svgicon icon_down_tick\" viewBox=\"0 0 37 20\" version=\"1.1\" aria-hidden width=\"12\"><path d=\"m2.0858 0c-1.1535 0-2.0858 0.86469-2.0858 1.9331 0 0.5139 0.21354 1.0183 0.38704 1.1881l18.113 16.879 18.112-16.879c0.174-0.1696 0.388-0.674 0.388-1.1879 0-1.068